  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing WASH Services for Post-Earthquake Camps at Hatay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal/ Impact: &#x2022; Reduction of waterborne diseases and promotion of health and dignity among Turk IDPs in Syrian refugee IDPs in Hatay camps.Objectives/ Outcomes:&#x2022; Improved long-term access to safe drinking water for 1,366 households in the targeted camps.Expected Results:&#x2022; Provision of drinking water by filtration of the existing water in EQ Hatay camps through either industrial or container-based water filters &#x2022; Provision of cleaning kits to families in Reyhanli and Kirkhan camps</narrative>
  </description>
